# --- Never commit copyrighted source material or lab-only content -------------
# Lab-only content packs live in a "private" folder next to the public packs and
# are listed in manifest.private.json. They are only copied to the lab server.
private/
**/private/
**/manifest.private.json
# Keep textbook PDFs, question-pool exports, and practice-exam books out of the repo.
sources/
*.pdf

